{"seq":1,"slug":"ts-morph","title":"ts-morph 上层封装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/tooling/ts-morph","wordCount":466,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"ts-morph-上层封装\">ts-morph 上层封装</h1><p>直接使用 TypeScript Compiler API 功能完整但极其底层——创建一个 Program、遍历 AST、修改节点然后写回文件，这套流程需要几十行样板代码。ts-morph 是社区最成熟的上层封装，它将 Compiler API 包装成面向对象的、可链式调用的 API，让&quot;像操作对象一样操作代码&quot;成为现实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ts-morph 的设计哲学是&quot;封装复杂性但不隐藏能力&quot;——你可以在任何需要的时候下沉到原始 Compiler API：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[ts-morph API Layer] --&gt; B[Project]&#10;    B --&gt; C[SourceFile]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Classes / Functions / Interfaces]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Properties / Methods / Parameters]&#10;    A --&gt; F[原始 ts.Node 可随时获取]&#10;    F --&gt; G[TypeScript Compiler API]\">graph TD\n    A[ts-morph API Layer] --&gt; B[Project]\n    B --&gt; C[SourceFile]\n    C --&gt; D[Classes / Functions / Interfaces]\n    D --&gt; E[Properties / Methods / Parameters]\n    A --&gt; F[原始 ts.Node 可随时获取]\n    F --&gt; G[TypeScript Compiler API]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>ts-morph 对象</th>\n<th>原始 API 等价物</th>\n<th>附加能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>项目</td>\n<td><code>Project</code></td>\n<td><code>ts.Program</code> + <code>ts.CompilerHost</code></td>\n<td>自动 tsconfig 解析、文件系统抽象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件</td>\n<td><code>SourceFile</code></td>\n<td><code>ts.SourceFile</code></td>\n<td>直接修改 + save/move/copy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点</td>\n<td>各类 Wrapper</td>\n<td><code>ts.Node</code> 子类型</td>\n<td>类型安全的 get/set/add/remove</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td><code>Type</code></td>\n<td><code>ts.Type</code></td>\n<td>简化的类型查询 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"项目创建与文件管理\">项目创建与文件管理</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Project, ScriptTarget } from &#39;ts-morph&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 从 tsconfig 创建（最常见）&#10;const project = new Project({&#10;  tsConfigFilePath: &#39;./tsconfig.json&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 手动配置&#10;const project2 = new Project({&#10;  compilerOptions: {&#10;    target: ScriptTarget.ES2020,&#10;    strict: true,&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 添加源文件&#10;project2.addSourceFilesAtPaths(&#39;src/**/*.ts&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 或创建虚拟源文件&#10;const virtual = project2.createSourceFile(&#10;  &#39;virtual.ts&#39;,&#10;  `export function hello(name: string) { return \\`Hi \\${name}\\`; }`,&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 获取所有源文件&#10;const sourceFiles = project.getSourceFiles();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Project, ScriptTarget } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ts-morph'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 从 tsconfig 创建（最常见）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> project</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tsConfigFilePath: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./tsconfig.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 手动配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> project2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  compilerOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target: ScriptTarget.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ES2020</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    strict: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 添加源文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">project2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addSourceFilesAtPaths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/**/*.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 或创建虚拟源文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> virtual</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> project2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createSourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'virtual.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  `export function hello(name: string) { return </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\`</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Hi </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{name}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\`</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">; }`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 获取所有源文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sourceFiles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> project.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getSourceFiles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"节点导航与查询\">节点导航与查询</h2><p>ts-morph 为每种常见的声明类型提供了类型安全的查询方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const sourceFile = project.getSourceFileOrThrow(&#39;src/service.ts&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 获取所有函数&#10;const functions = sourceFile.getFunctions();&#10;&#10;// 按名字精确查找&#10;const handler = sourceFile.getFunctionOrThrow(&#39;handleRequest&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 获取所有类&#10;const classes = sourceFile.getClasses();&#10;const userClass = sourceFile.getClassOrThrow(&#39;UserService&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 获取接口&#10;const interfaces = sourceFile.getInterfaces();&#10;&#10;// 获取导出&#10;const exports = sourceFile.getExportedDeclarations();&#10;&#10;// 通用后代搜索&#10;const allCalls = sourceFile.getDescendantsOfKind(SyntaxKind.CallExpression);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> project.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getSourceFileOrThrow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/service.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 获取所有函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> functions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceFile.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getFunctions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按名字精确查找</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceFile.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getFunctionOrThrow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'handleRequest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 获取所有类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> classes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceFile.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getClasses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userClass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceFile.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getClassOrThrow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UserService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 获取接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> interfaces</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceFile.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getInterfaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 获取导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> exports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceFile.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getExportedDeclarations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通用后代搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> allCalls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceFile.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getDescendantsOfKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SyntaxKind.CallExpression);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个 Wrapper 对象都提供了进一步导航到子结构的方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 类 → 方法 → 参数 → 类型&#10;const method = userClass.getMethodOrThrow(&#39;findById&#39;);&#10;const params = method.getParameters();&#10;const returnType = method.getReturnType();&#10;&#10;console.log(method.getName()); // &quot;findById&quot;&#10;console.log(params[0].getName()); // &quot;id&quot;&#10;console.log(params[0].getType().getText()); // &quot;string&quot;&#10;console.log(returnType.getText()); // &quot;Promise&lt;User | null&gt;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类 → 方法 → 参数 → 类型</span></span